cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use basemapper, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "basemapper: Headless Spatial Basemap Renderer"
abstract: >-
  Renders MapLibre GL styled basemaps (vector and raster tiles) headlessly
  with a Rust core: a software port of MapLibre GL JS's renderer, tested
  pixel by pixel against MapLibre GL JS. Packages for R (ggplot2, tmap)
  and Python (matplotlib, plotnine, xarray) share the core.
authors:
  - given-names: Pukar
    family-names: Bhandari
# Zenodo's concept DOI: it covers every version and resolves to the latest.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24457061
repository-code: "https://github.com/ar-puuk/basemapper"
url: "https://ar-puuk.github.io/basemapper/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - basemap
  - maplibre
  - vector tiles
  - cartography
  - rust
  - r
  - python
version: "0.3.1"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
